'''Hiroshi Mihara''' is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in the [[Hiroshi Mihara Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Hiroshi Mihara
|image = E 313.png
|appearance = [[Hiroshi Mihara Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 5,000元 - 19,750元
}}

==Enemy==
Similar to [[Pikotaro (Enemy)|Pikotaro]] with shorter animations in exchange for range.

==Strategy==
Rushing him with quick units such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] should do, or just use [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat]] or any other cat that has the critical hit ability such as [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]].

